{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14213390","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14213390","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1421339001:1":{"text":"呵！伟大的伊娜领袖的判断果然从无错漏！","source_cn":"呵！伟大的伊娜领袖的判断果然从无错漏！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7EB9350DFA0CFC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421339002:1":{"text":"可憎的守旧者果然引领着外来之民踏足我等矮人的圣域！","source_cn":"可憎的守旧者果然引领着外来之民踏足我等矮人的圣域！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x736083333616CD44","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421339003:1":{"text":"……呃，照理说这里其实应该算是尖耳朵的地盘内……算了，当我没说。","source_cn":"……呃，照理说这里其实应该算是尖耳朵的地盘内……算了，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF1465AAC37B1F89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421339004:1":{"text":"孩子们，伊娜就在里面吗？你们怎么发现的这个地方？","source_cn":"孩子们，伊娜就在里面吗？你们怎么发现的这个地方？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A71E7486D3ECD94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421339005:1":{"text":"复兴的希望之光引领着我们，而我们将振翅腾飞！","source_cn":"复兴的希望之光引领着我们，而我们将振翅腾飞！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68373C6BD87E779D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"